{"page":110,"width":1684,"height":2200,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"*장 데0터 모* 성능","words":[{"text":"*장","x":1248,"y":79,"width":60,"height":26},{"text":"데0터","x":1319,"y":78,"width":65,"height":25},{"text":"모*","x":1396,"y":79,"width":63,"height":25},{"text":"성능","x":1469,"y":78,"width":43,"height":26}]},{"text":"본질식별지에 대해 고민하지 않았기 때문이다. 대체로 모델에 대한 이해도가 높지 않은 상태에서 모델을 설계하다","words":[{"text":"본질식별지에","x":177,"y":210,"width":150,"height":30},{"text":"대해","x":339,"y":210,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"고민하지","x":399,"y":212,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"않았기","x":512,"y":211,"width":73,"height":31},{"text":"때문이다.","x":597,"y":211,"width":110,"height":29},{"text":"대체로","x":721,"y":212,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"모델에","x":812,"y":213,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"대한","x":906,"y":213,"width":53,"height":29},{"text":"이해도가","x":971,"y":211,"width":102,"height":30},{"text":"높지","x":1083,"y":211,"width":49,"height":30},{"text":"않은","x":1145,"y":211,"width":53,"height":30},{"text":"상태에서","x":1207,"y":210,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"모델을","x":1322,"y":211,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"설계하다","x":1409,"y":209,"width":101,"height":31}]},{"text":"보면, 식별자는 유일성과 존재성(Unique, Not null)만 만족하면 된다고 생각할 수 있기 때문이다. DBMS에서","words":[{"text":"보면,","x":177,"y":258,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"식별자는","x":250,"y":257,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"유일성과","x":362,"y":258,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"존재성(Unique,","x":477,"y":259,"width":187,"height":34},{"text":"Not","x":679,"y":261,"width":49,"height":24},{"text":"null)만","x":741,"y":259,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"만족하면","x":847,"y":260,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"된다고","x":968,"y":259,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"생각할","x":1060,"y":258,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":1150,"y":259,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"있기","x":1190,"y":258,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"때문이다.","x":1256,"y":258,"width":109,"height":30},{"text":"DBMS에서","x":1380,"y":257,"width":127,"height":30}]},{"text":"기본71(Prim